  "title": "Chef Hoppie Throws His First Annual Charcuterie Board and Debut New Series 'Glacier Talk'",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":517089,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/295027898_389961603225756_9129882138180082924_n-821x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-517089\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Chef Hoppie here, and I recently threw a Charcuterie Board Battle. Everybody had to bring their little shin and did their little makeup on their own little boards, so we'll see how everybody did. So far, it's looking good. I'm very impressed, so let's get to it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/3phE2KjJIR4\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/3phE2KjJIR4\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I will also be rolling out a new series called Glacier Talk: The Cold Hard Truth. During this series I will be giving you some motivational tips, and speaking a little bit of reality in certain situations. Things that I go through and things that others go through. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Ci6Hr1FgcCK/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/reel/Ci6Hr1FgcCK/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Make sure you stay tapped in with me on Chef Hoppie TV and all my socials @ChefHoppie!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
